EXT. TIDAL SANDS - DAY

Nell walks out across wet sand toward a low island. Behind her, the town shrinks.

>THE ISLAND<

She stops. Footprints, two sets, lead away from her and do not come back.

NELL
Tom?

Only the gulls answer.
